I didn't know that was an act,

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:17.860
John Carriaco began serving a 30 month prison sentence.

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:20.940
His crime, blowing the whistle on the CIA's

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:23.780
