00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:26.300
Doing Time Like a Spy is Carriaco's memoirs

00:13:26.300 --> 00:13:28.740
of his 23 months in prison.

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:30.380
Using 20 life skills he learned

00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:32.540
in the CIA operational training,

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:34.220
he was able to keep himself safe

00:13:34.220 --> 00:13:37.020
and at the top of the prison's social heap.

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:39.300
Including his award-winning blog series,

00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:40.860
Letters from Loretto,

00:13:40.860 --> 00:13:43.580
Doing Time Like a Spy is at once a serene journal

00:13:43.580 --> 00:13:45.260
of daily prison life

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:48.580
and an alternately funny and heartbreaking commentary

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:50.160
on the federal prison system.

00:13:51.940 --> 00:13:52.780
